          "short": "$3$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(\\sqrt{7}+2)(\\sqrt{7}-2)&=(\\sqrt{7})^2-2^2\\\\(\\sqrt{7}+2)(\\sqrt{7}-2)&=7-4\\\\(\\sqrt{7}+2)(\\sqrt{7}-2)&=3\\end{align*}$$",
